ms.gov/medicare-coverage-database/view/ncacal-decision-memo.aspx?ncaid=313&proposed=Y","why":"A service worker is what makes offline access, caching, and background sync possible."},{"id":"pwa-theme-color","label":"Theme color declared","status":"fail","evidence":"","exampleUrl":"https://www.cms.gov/medicare-coverage-database/view/ncacal-decision-memo.aspx?ncaid=313&proposed=Y","why":"Theme color controls the browser chrome/status-bar color when the site is installed or bookmarked."},{"id":"pwa-apple-touch-icon","label":"Apple touch icon (iOS/bookmark icon)","status":"fail","evidence":"","exampleUrl":"https://www.cms.gov/medicare-coverage-database/view/ncacal-decision-memo.aspx?ncaid=313&proposed=Y","why":"iOS uses this icon for home-screen bookmarks and \"Add to Home Screen\" — without it the icon falls back to a screenshot."},{"id":"manifest-parsed","label":"Manifest fetched and parsed successfully","status":"n/a","evidence":"No manifest declared","exampleUrl":"https://www.cms.gov/medicare-coverage-database/view/ncacal-decision-memo.aspx?ncaid=313&proposed=Y","why":"A manifest that fails to parse cannot drive installability or launch behavior even if the link is present."},{"id":"manifest-maskable-icon","label":"Manifest declares a maskable icon","status":"n/a","evidence":"No manifest declared","exampleUrl":"https://www.cms.gov/medicare-coverage-database/view/ncacal-decision-memo.aspx?ncaid=313&proposed=Y","why":"A maskable icon lets the OS safely crop/mask the app icon on different device shapes without clipping content."},{"id":"sw-active","label":"Service worker is active (not just registered)","status":"fail","evidence":"","exampleUrl":"https://www.cms.gov/medicare-coverage-database/view/ncacal-decision-memo.aspx?ncaid=313&proposed=Y","why":"An active service worker (not just registered) is what actually intercepts requests and serves cached content."},{"id":"sw-controlling","label":"Service worker controls this page load","status":"fail","evidence":"","exampleUrl":"https://www.cms.gov/medicare-coverage-database/view/ncacal-decision-memo.aspx?ncaid=313&proposed=Y","why":"A controlling service worker means THIS page load is being served/intercepted, not just a future one."},{"id":"installable","label":"Meets basic installability criteria","status":"fail","evidence":"no readable web app manifest; no service worker registered","exampleUrl":"https://www.cms.gov/medicare-coverage-database/view/ncacal-decision-memo.aspx?ncaid=313&proposed=Y","why":"Determines whether the browser can realistically offer \"Add to Home Screen\" / install, based on manifest + service worker + HTTPS together."}],"manifest":null,"serviceWorker":{"registered":false,"active":false,"installing":false,"waiting":false,"controllingThisPage":false}}}}